{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Search for object, then move to it, inspect it, retrieve it, otherwise scan and move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
